{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q414226","formula":"C₁₁H₈N₂","hill":"C11H8N2","elements":["H","C","N"],"composition":{"C":11.0,"H":8.0,"N":2.0},"names":{"en":"Norharman","ru":"Бета-карболин"},"descriptions":{"en":"β-Carboline, also known as norharman, norharmane, or 9H-pyrido[3,4-b]indole, is a tricyclic chemical compound and alkaloid. It is the parent structure of the substituted β-carbolines, a large group of alkaloids and synthetic compounds. β-Carboline may be thought of as a cyclized tryptamine.","ru":"β-Карболин (норгарман) — 9H-пиридо[3,4-b]индол. β-Карболиновая структура является основой для ряда алкалоидов, выделенных из растений (гармала и др.), известных под общим названием «β-карболины». Изомерен α-карболину (1H-пиридо[2,3-b]индолу) и γ-карболину (5H-пиридо[4,3-b]индолу)."},"fame":23,"pubchemCid":64961,"mass":168.19,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC=C2C(=C1)C3=C(N2)C=NC=C3","inchikey":"AIFRHYZBTHREPW-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"9H-pyrido[3,4-b]indole","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"64961","atoms":21,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.018,"y":-1.627,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":3.421,"y":-0.205,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.714,"y":0.48,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.717,"y":0.491,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.121,"y":-0.855,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.141,"y":-0.838,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.703,"y":1.486,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.467,"y":-1.236,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.69,"y":1.503,"z":0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":2.486,"y":-1.183,"z":-0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.054,"y":1.121,"z":-0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.428,"y":-0.221,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":3.013,"y":1.084,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.025,"y":-2.638,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.427,"y":2.537,"z":-0.001,"el":"H"},{"x":-2.76,"y":-2.281,"z":0.001,"el":"H"},{"x":1.431,"y":2.555,"z":0.001,"el":"H"},{"x":2.84,"y":-2.206,"z":-0.001,"el":"H"},{"x":